Prompts: Tech Stack

Purpose:
  Convert simple human prompts into architecture docs and .sdd/project/.
  Supports the full human-in-the-loop workflow.

Modes:
  GENERATE_DOCS — convert prompt to human docs
  CONVERT_SDD  — convert approved docs to .sdd/project/
  EXECUTE      — execute .sdd/project/ chains
  REVIEW       — human review gate

Rules:
  [PE1] Human MUST approve docs before .sdd/project/ generation.
  [PE2] Human MUST approve .sdd/project/ before code execution.
  [PE3] Human MUST approve production deployment.
  [PE4] All approvals MUST be recorded.
  [PE5] Docs MUST be in simple language.
  [PE6] .sdd/project/ MUST be machine-readable.
  [PE7] Tech stack MUST resolve to valid skills.
  [PE8] Best practices MUST be included in docs.

Navigation:
  PromptEngine: @prompts/INDEX.sdd
  PromptToDocs: @prompts/tech-stack/prompt-to-docs.sdd
  DocsToProject: @prompts/tech-stack/docs-to-project.sdd
  HumanInTheLoop: @prompts/role-assignment/human-in-the-loop.sdd

State: +
